                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W4832500                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  READ W48323 (OR VYYWW.FRAKT) CONTAINING               *        
*                TRANSPORTS INFORMATION AND CREATE A FILE              *        
*                WITH ADDITIONAL LOADING DATE INFO. "LOADING WEEK"     *        
*                "LOADING MONTH" AND "LOADING PERIOD" IS ADDED         *        
*                IT WILL BE USED AS INPUT TO UPDATE DB2 TABLES         *        
*                USED IN A WEB BASED DATA WAREHOUSE SYSTEM (Q&A)       *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  KJELL A                                               *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W48325D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W4832301  'IN-'                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W48325D2 FB(262 0)                                                         
*                                                                               
%W4832501 'UT-'                                                                 
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
%WDATAREA                                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
WDATKONV                      W  8  A VALUE 'WDATKONV'                          
SPAR-TILASTN                  W  4  P VALUE 0                                   
                                                                                
W-TIAAVV-GRP                  W  4  A                                           
W-TIAAVV     W-TIAAVV-GRP        4  N                                           
                                                                                
W-TIAAMMDD-GRP                W  6  A                                           
W-TIAAMM   W-TIAAMMDD-GRP        4  N                                           
                                                                                
W-TIAARP-GRP                  W  4  A                                           
W-TIAARP     W-TIAARP-GRP        4  N                                           
                                                                                
W-TIAA                        W  2  N                                           
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEG 1. COMPUTE WEEK, MONTH AND PERIOD                                        
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W48325D1                                                              
                                                                                
  UT-W4832501      = IN-W4832301                                                
                                                                                
  IF SPAR-TILASTN NE IN-TILASTN                                                 
    PERFORM B-COMPUTE-DATE-INFO                                                 
  END-IF                                                                        
  UT-TIAAVV-LASTN   = W-TIAAVV                                                  
  UT-TIAAMM-LASTN   = W-TIAAMM                                                  
  UT-TIAARP-LASTN   = W-TIAARP                                                  
  UT-TIAA-LASTN     = W-TIAA                                                    
                                                                                
  PUT W48325D2                                                                  
                                                                                
                                                                                
  NEWPAGE                                                                       
B-COMPUTE-DATE-INFO. PROC                                                       
                                                                                
  DAT-KDDATFORM = 'AAMMDD'                                                      
  DAT-I-TIDATUM = IN-TILASTN                                                    
                                                                                
  CALL WDATKONV USING (DAT-KDDATFORM, +                                         
                       DAT-I-TIDATUM, +                                         
                       DAT-O-TIDATUM, +                                         
                       DAT-KDSVAR)                                              
                                                                                
  W-TIAAVV-GRP      = DAT-TIAAVV-GRP                                            
  W-TIAAMMDD-GRP    = DAT-TIAAMMDD-GRP                                          
  W-TIAARP-GRP      = DAT-TIAARP-GRP                                            
  W-TIAA            = DAT-TIAA                                                  
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
